arguments.prompt:
You are implementing a Blazor Web App for a recipe sharing community. The project has already been scaffolded at `/tmp/sv-e207dc7770054b829416f0d3eee7c2ed/RecipeShare` using `dotnet new blazor -int Server` (Interactive Server, per-page).

The project uses .NET with Bootstrap CSS available. Pages are static SSR by default; only components that need interactivity get `@rendermode InteractiveServer`.

## Requirements
- Homepage displays recipe categories (static content)
- Browse recipes by category — read-only content pages
- Each recipe page has a star-rating widget (click to rate 1–5 stars) — this needs `@rendermode InteractiveServer`
- A "Submit Recipe" page with a form (title, ingredients, steps) — this needs interactivity
- Most pages are read-only; only the rating widget and submit form need interactivity

## What to implement

### 1. Delete template default pages
Delete these files:
- `Components/Pages/Counter.razor`
- `Components/Pages/Weather.razor`

### 2. Create `Models/Recipe.cs`
A simple in-memory model:

```csharp
namespace RecipeShare.Models;

public class Recipe
{
    public int Id { get; set; }
    public string Title { get; set; } = "";
    public string Category { get; set; } = "";
    public string Description { get; set; } = "";
    public List<string> Ingredients { get; set; } = new();
    public List<string> Steps { get; set; } = new();
    public int TotalRatingPoints { get; set; }
    public int RatingCount { get; set; }
    public double AverageRating => RatingCount > 0 ? (double)TotalRatingPoints / RatingCount : 0;
}
```

### 3. Create `Services/RecipeService.cs`
